Package: com.mbucc9000.reactions
Name: Reactions
Version: 2.1.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Shows tapback reactions in iOS 6 Messages, in stock iOS 6 style. Reacting and swipe-to-reply are optional and off by default; they send plain text, not real reactions.
Author: mbucc9000
Maintainer: mbucc9000
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
